	        <p><table height='22' border='0' cellspacing='0' cellpadding='0' width='100%'><tr><td width='500' align='center'><font face='verdana' color='#999999' size='1'><strong>[Wednesday, Oct 24, 2001]</strong></font></td></tr></table>
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
<tr height="1">
<td colspan="3" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
</tr><tr>
<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
<td width="*"><div style="margin: 5px"><font color="#c0c0c0" face="verdana" size="1"><font style="font-weight:700"><A NAME="988745154">Patch ballin</font> - <A HREF="mailto:dennis@byran1och2.se">Freyi</A> - 13:46</font></div></td>
<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
</tr><tr height="1">
<td colspan="3" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
</tr><tr>
<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
<td width="*"><div style="margin: 5px"><font color="#c0c0c0" size="2" face="verdana">
Patch, and we visited old friend Trakanon. Been about a month since we saw our old rotting friend.
Since he havn't paid the NK maffia for protection the last few weeks we had to lay a smack down.
Mr cheap dropped SS BP and a CoP as usual. (well could been worse with more BE BPs).<br>
After that most went to Hole to get Keeper of the tombs for Nagguks. Mr Yael wasn't up, he bugged or what?,
so scalekeeper got his ass kicked due to our frustration with Mr Yael.<br>
During the Hole expedition Madlen was busy in Fear with Iceni and finished her Fiery Defender.
Grats Madlen and thank you Iceni.<br><br>
I also want to extend my own and Amascus gratitude towards Verant. Thank you A-holes for
making Crystal Mask completly useless (except in Kedge Keep). Nice stealth nerf there you f***s.

</font>
</p>
</font></div></td>
<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
</tr>
  <tr height="1" bgcolor="#333333"> 
    <td colspan="3"></td>
</tr></table><br>	

	        <p><table height='22' border='0' cellspacing='0' cellpadding='0' width='100%'><tr><td width='500' align='center'><font face='verdana' color='#999999' size='1'><strong>[Tuesday, Oct 23, 2001]</strong></font></td></tr></table>
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
<tr height="1">
<td colspan="3" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
</tr><tr>
<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
<td width="*"><div style="margin: 5px"><font color="#c0c0c0" face="verdana" size="1"><font style="font-weight:700"><A NAME="988745154">Epics and stuff</font> - <A HREF="mailto:dennis@byran1och2.se">Freyi</A> - 11:32</font></div></td>
<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
</tr><tr height="1">
<td colspan="3" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
</tr><tr>
<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
<td width="*"><div style="margin: 5px"><font color="#c0c0c0" size="2" face="verdana">
I would like to welcome Ndayael and Ptipierrot to the NK Family.<br>
We got some stuff done even tho it was monday :-o<br>
Sonal finished his epic, the 40th epic in the Guild!! WOOAAH<br>
Rabidsheep closed in on her epic to, just a few parts left now hun.<br>
Oh grats guild bank on the 236th Blood Ember BP.
</font>
</p>
</font></div></td>
<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
</tr>
  <tr height="1" bgcolor="#333333"> 
    <td colspan="3"></td>
</tr></table><br>	

	        <p><table height='22' border='0' cellspacing='0' cellpadding='0' width='100%'><tr><td width='500' align='center'><font face='verdana' color='#999999' size='1'><strong>[Monday, Oct 22, 2001]</strong></font></td></tr></table>
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
<tr height="1">
<td colspan="3" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
</tr><tr>
<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
<td width="*"><div style="margin: 5px"><font color="#c0c0c0" face="verdana" size="1"><font style="font-weight:700"><A NAME="988745154">Woah, pain and suffering</font> - <A HREF="mailto:dennis@byran1och2.se">Freyi</A> - 11:57</font></div></td>
<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
</tr><tr height="1">
<td colspan="3" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
</tr><tr>
<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
<td width="*"><div style="margin: 5px"><font color="#c0c0c0" size="2" face="verdana">God damn, what does it take to get to 7th (sphinx/drake) island in Plane of Sky?....2 days, lots of coffee, and immense amounts of stress.<br>
We had some serious PoAing going on the last few days. Results were very nice.<br>
Grats Nagguks,Madlen and Varrioth on Fiery Avenger.<br>
Gorguuk on necro cloak for necro epic.<br>
Tons of ranger globes for whoever needed those ;-p.<br>
Stridiz,warlace,reshep + 1 more warrior on sprioc wingblade for epic.<br>
Zirek on his new ~40% haste belt, blade of abrogation for epic and becomming a NK member.<br>
<br>
During the last week we had a few people ding, on top of my head i can think of Blackrose and Theomil<br>
hitting the big 60.<br>
Qaldaar also finished his wiz epic, and Valour got her res stick, Sshy his lightsabers.<br>
<br>
So now there is a total of 39 epics in the guild, hopefully we will burst thru the 40-mark during the next week.<br>
/Freyi
</font>
</p>
</font></div></td>
<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
</tr>
  <tr height="1" bgcolor="#333333"> 
    <td colspan="3"></td>
</tr></table><br>

	        <p><table height='22' border='0' cellspacing='0' cellpadding='0' width='100%'><tr><td width='500' align='center'><font face='verdana' color='#999999' size='1'><strong>[Monday, Oct 15, 2001]</strong></font></td></tr></table>
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
<tr height="1">
<td colspan="3" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
</tr><tr>
<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
<td width="*"><div style="margin: 5px"><font color="#c0c0c0" face="verdana" size="1"><font style="font-weight:700"><A NAME="988745154">Stuffies</font> - <A HREF="mailto:dennis@byran1och2.se">Freyi</A> - 10:45</font></div></td>
<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
</tr><tr height="1">
<td colspan="3" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
</tr><tr>
<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
<td width="*"><div style="margin: 5px"><font color="#c0c0c0" size="2" face="verdana">Sorry for the lack of updates, but its been very busy. We lost a few members to DAoC and other reasons. But that only gave us opertunity to open up recruitment again :-).<br>
So if you wanna come hang with us shoot a member a tell to see whats happening. The last 2 weeks we all been pretty busy with doing those last levels before 60.<br>
Epics have also been on the agenda. 4 Generals for rudious/arme+2 guests. Druid leafblower for Cadena, Broken Golem for Qaldaar, Ixblat for Valour, Green dragonscale for sshy etc etc<br>
Last friday/saturday we had another ToV run, this time finally having some luck :-)<br>
Grats Mandos and Crystina on Templar's Breastplate, Batoo on necro robe, Amascus on Deciever's Breastplate, Thinn on shaman breastplate and tons of other people on their new tov parts :-) </font>
</p>
</font></div></td>
<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
</tr>
  <tr height="1" bgcolor="#333333"> 
    <td colspan="3"></td>
</tr></table><br>
