<td width="1" bgcolor="#333333"></td>
<td width="*"><div style="margin: 5px"><font color="#c0c0c0" size="2" face="verdana">As usual after patch we are busy busy. On patch day we first disposed of Miragul in order to have Nagguks progress further on his Epic quest. 30 mins later we gathered up in Karnors for some swift Venril action. Traknon wasn't in the mood that day and neither was we, so he was still standing when we logged. Day after patch was dragon mania. Both Gore and Talendor went down.</font></a>
<font color="#c0c0c0" size="2" face="verdana"><br><br>Congratulations:<br>
Rudious on his new <a href="http://gameznet.com/eq/equipment/gauntletsofmight.html" target="new window">Gauntlets of Fiery Might</a>,<br>
Bemoth on his new <a href="http://eq.gameznet.com/equipment/mrylokarsgreaves.html" target="new window">Mrylokar's Greaves</a>,<br>
Nossy on her new <a href="http://eq.gameznet.com/equipment/shieldofthereddragon.html" target="new window">Shield of the Red Dragon</a>,<br>
And Madlen, Varrioth on their missing books, Reptil on a bag, Bank on red scale,orb etc.
</p>
</font></div></td>
